      DISCONN   line/DSR dropped (rule 19)        -> 304, global (BSEL3 = 0)
      STRTRCVD  STRT received in Run (rule 20)    -> 010, tributary halted
                (rule 19 also reports STRTRCVD after a disconnect: the 304
